{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Dangers lurking everywhere</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The seemingly peaceful and beautiful natural scenery may be ambushed by brutal alien creatures. Animals with cute appearance may have been infected and may suddenly attack when approached. You need to be ready with weapons to repel them at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633400/extras/GIF_1_00_00_00-00_00_30.gif?t=1743739007\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Strengthen skills</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect props through exploration, or destroy meteorites and other items to obtain resources, use resources to make or upgrade weapons, and unlock more powerful skills. More than 10 weapons are available for play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633400/extras/GIF_2-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1743739007\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Biotechnology</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat powerful monsters to obtain their DNA information, unlock powerful biotechnology, and transform into various animals and giant monsters, and unlock special skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633400/extras/GIF_3.gif?t=1743739007\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Friendly interaction</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use various skills to help each other with good friends, such as using the transformation skill to turn your friends into cats to escape the monster's pursuit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633400/extras/GIF_4_00_00_00-00_00_30.gif?t=1743739007\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3633400?t=1743739007","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3633400?t=1743739007","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633400/ce595375ac763a02cce86f42e986782adf66f3e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743739007","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633400/ce595375ac763a02cce86f42e986782adf66f3e1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743739007","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Dangers lurking everywhere</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The seemingly peaceful and beautiful natural scenery may be ambushed by brutal alien creatures. Animals with cute appearance may have been infected and may suddenly attack when approached. You need to be ready with weapons to repel them at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633400/extras/GIF_1_00_00_00-00_00_30.gif?t=1743739007\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Strengthen skills</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect props through exploration, or destroy meteorites and other items to obtain resources, use resources to make or upgrade weapons, and unlock more powerful skills. More than 10 weapons are available for play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633400/extras/GIF_2-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.g